<title>USA: Gentia Software changes ticker symbol.</title>
<headline>Gentia Software changes ticker symbol.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentia Software, formerly known as Planning Sciences International Plc, said Wednesday that it has officialy changed its NASDAQ ticker symbol to GNTIY.O.</p>
<p>The company provides networked business intelligence software.</p>
</text>
